# YouTube Trending Video Analytics

## Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing YouTube trending videos to identify patterns in views, likes, comments, engagement, sentiment, countries, categories, and trending duration.

This project is completed as part of **Task 4 – YouTube Trending Video Analytics**.

## Objective

- Analyze patterns in YouTube trending videos.
- Compare video performance across different countries/regions.
- Analyze video categories based on average views.
- Perform sentiment analysis on video titles and tags.
- Analyze how long videos remain trending.
- Create an interactive Power BI dashboard.

## Dataset

**Dataset Name:** YouTube Trending Videos Dataset

### Main Columns Used

- `video_id`
- `title`
- `channel_title`
- `category_id`
- `publish_country`
- `publish_date`
- `trending_date`
- `views`
- `likes`
- `dislikes`
- `comment_count`
- `engagement_rate`
- `title_sentiment`
- `tag_sentiment`

